{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xenopurge</strong> is a tactical auto-battler where you command an elite squad remotely, deep in the warzones of Xenowarfare. As part of M.A.C.E. (<i>Mercer\u2019s Advanced Combat Enterprises</i>), your mission is clear: purge all these aliens to keep humanity safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From several computer screens, you'll see the layout of the facilities your units traverse, directing them to search, recover and destroy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Xeno menace is relentless. To survive, you\u2019ll need sharp tactics, upgraded gear, and a willingness to sacrifice. You\u2019re not in the field\u2014but their lives are in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/41fe74383a9dec8a13fc5ed8f1911c60.poster.avif?t=1769683254\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/41fe74383a9dec8a13fc5ed8f1911c60.webm?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/41fe74383a9dec8a13fc5ed8f1911c60.mp4?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You give the orders, they fight for their lives</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of a classic top-down view of the battlefield, you operate from a remote command center surrounded by screens and data feeds. You can give orders to your troops from a list of instructions but will have a limited range of direct actions to impact the battlefield. Xenopurge is more about anticipation and planning, than reaction and control.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/17f16c064e706e973e4fe4238e5379a3.poster.avif?t=1769683254\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/17f16c064e706e973e4fe4238e5379a3.webm?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/17f16c064e706e973e4fe4238e5379a3.mp4?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit and equip your squad</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the mission unfolds, you'll have the chance to bring in new squad members with their own starting tactical methods. Gear them up to fit your command style \u2014 shaping a team built for your tactical needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/3a545b1595122a6d9c3c7313730e45d5.poster.avif?t=1769683254\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/3a545b1595122a6d9c3c7313730e45d5.webm?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/3a545b1595122a6d9c3c7313730e45d5.mp4?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience a tense tactical auto-battler</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're leading your troops to hunt and exterminate alien threats in the depths of space. Ominous, dark spaceships inspired by the likes of Alien &amp; Space Hulk combined with a retro-futuristic aesthetics, creating a creeping horror atmosphere where every decision feels critical.  It\u2019s not just about tactics \u2014 it\u2019s about surviving the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/b6b91932a47157c43101658ff943ea08.poster.avif?t=1769683254\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/b6b91932a47157c43101658ff943ea08.webm?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/b6b91932a47157c43101658ff943ea08.mp4?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep improving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters with the tension of death looming over your shoulders, countered with the satisfaction of roguelite continuous progression, you'll shape your strategies to overcome the evolving threats. Expand your command abilities and unlock new recruit options after every run. Success or failure, you will become a better leader.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/c89d570010ddf61c5cb506570fb1b60b.poster.avif?t=1769683254\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/c89d570010ddf61c5cb506570fb1b60b.webm?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/c89d570010ddf61c5cb506570fb1b60b.mp4?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quick Diverse Engaging Sessions \u2013 Playable in Short Bursts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for fast, intense tactical runs, Xenopurge lets players complete a run in around 60 minutes\u2014This makes it easy to pick up and play, whether you have time for a single mission or an extended session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps ensure no two missions are the same, with variable layouts, enemies, keeping each run unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combined with diverse objectives like search, escort, extraction, and destruction, every mission becomes a fresh tactical challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sentinel Strike - Variant I - A","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2983410/f4ad1c78057a073ca3c36ce2fd81d2519c11b925.jpg"},{"name":"Sentinel Strike - Variant I - B","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2983410/22e564b204cb25d73ce3289f4f060d8e9b1aee74.jpg"},{"name":"Sentinel Strike - Variant I - C","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2983410/dcc0312e6feabb560bf276764e28066a8edcbfcb.jpg"},{"name":"Sentinel Strike - Variant I - D","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2983410/29a705d66575259678b7c8c62506613f0e06133a.jpg"},{"name":"Sentinel Strike - Variant I - E","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2983410/8c4d0cbd762b6b25b3540312a5b5548ed9ce6716.jpg"},{"name":"Sentinel Strike - Variant I - F","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2983410/53aa4c3fd031419ed48748b49599156e88e11d22.jpg"},{"name":"Sentinel Strike - Variant II - A","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2983410/09bd920aa3f7bb57fb4a4ccadb330664f456f9b4.jpg"},{"name":"Sentinel Strike - Variant II - B","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2983410/496ba3c321b18c66526850440e2952f20c16365f.jpg"},{"name":"Sentinel Strike - Variant II - C","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2983410/359ba82b4c0067b51426aa65b04adf662119fcaa.jpg"},{"name":"Sentinel Strike - Variant II - D","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2983410/6f8da018ddb7a16ec679080da040a5c104e78c53.jpg"}],"total":151},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2983410?t=1769683254","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/710f589c47e68d7b4d6e73ce4dc74d802f76d39c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769683254","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/130d219f06a0b3e3ef14da61c5996110214c3dd9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769683254","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/130d219f06a0b3e3ef14da61c5996110214c3dd9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769683254","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3175750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xenopurge</strong> is a tactical auto-battler where you command an elite squad remotely, deep in the warzones of Xenowarfare. As part of M.A.C.E. (<i>Mercer\u2019s Advanced Combat Enterprises</i>), your mission is clear: purge all these aliens to keep humanity safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From several computer screens, you'll see the layout of the facilities your units traverse, directing them to search, recover and destroy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Xeno menace is relentless. To survive, you\u2019ll need sharp tactics, upgraded gear, and a willingness to sacrifice. You\u2019re not in the field\u2014but their lives are in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/41fe74383a9dec8a13fc5ed8f1911c60.poster.avif?t=1769683254\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/41fe74383a9dec8a13fc5ed8f1911c60.webm?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/41fe74383a9dec8a13fc5ed8f1911c60.mp4?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You give the orders, they fight for their lives</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of a classic top-down view of the battlefield, you operate from a remote command center surrounded by screens and data feeds. You can give orders to your troops from a list of instructions but will have a limited range of direct actions to impact the battlefield. Xenopurge is more about anticipation and planning, than reaction and control.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/17f16c064e706e973e4fe4238e5379a3.poster.avif?t=1769683254\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/17f16c064e706e973e4fe4238e5379a3.webm?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/17f16c064e706e973e4fe4238e5379a3.mp4?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit and equip your squad</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the mission unfolds, you'll have the chance to bring in new squad members with their own starting tactical methods. Gear them up to fit your command style \u2014 shaping a team built for your tactical needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/3a545b1595122a6d9c3c7313730e45d5.poster.avif?t=1769683254\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/3a545b1595122a6d9c3c7313730e45d5.webm?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/3a545b1595122a6d9c3c7313730e45d5.mp4?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience a tense tactical auto-battler</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're leading your troops to hunt and exterminate alien threats in the depths of space. Ominous, dark spaceships inspired by the likes of Alien &amp; Space Hulk combined with a retro-futuristic aesthetics, creating a creeping horror atmosphere where every decision feels critical.  It\u2019s not just about tactics \u2014 it\u2019s about surviving the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/b6b91932a47157c43101658ff943ea08.poster.avif?t=1769683254\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/b6b91932a47157c43101658ff943ea08.webm?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/b6b91932a47157c43101658ff943ea08.mp4?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep improving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters with the tension of death looming over your shoulders, countered with the satisfaction of roguelite continuous progression, you'll shape your strategies to overcome the evolving threats. Expand your command abilities and unlock new recruit options after every run. Success or failure, you will become a better leader.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/c89d570010ddf61c5cb506570fb1b60b.poster.avif?t=1769683254\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/c89d570010ddf61c5cb506570fb1b60b.webm?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/extras/c89d570010ddf61c5cb506570fb1b60b.mp4?t=1769683254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quick Diverse Engaging Sessions \u2013 Playable in Short Bursts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for fast, intense tactical runs, Xenopurge lets players complete a run in around 60 minutes\u2014This makes it easy to pick up and play, whether you have time for a single mission or an extended session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps ensure no two missions are the same, with variable layouts, enemies, keeping each run unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combined with diverse objectives like search, escort, extraction, and destruction, every mission becomes a fresh tactical challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Traptics"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/759ffd38c211a0ebc815f1997201d6651d4f7001/header.jpg?t=1769683254","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Xenopurge. Developed by Traptics and published by Firesquid. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2983410/274397246/7a427f205e366e52c9299eb649bca08323db5de8/1763402042/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763660468","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2983410/274397246/7a427f205e366e52c9299eb649bca08323db5de8/1763402042/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763660468","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2983410/274397246/7a427f205e366e52c9299eb649bca08323db5de8/1763402042/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763660468","id":257233468,"name":"Xenopurge - Full Release trailer (V1.0)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257233468/01fd64a844919268a1fc82fba2a237cd31931270/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763660468"}],"name":"Xenopurge","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Xenopurge - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$12.49</span> $7.49 USD","packageid":1061652,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-40% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":749}],"title":"Buy Xenopurge"}],"packages":[1061652],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5 4690K or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 750 Ti or AMD Radeon RX 460<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 30+ FPS</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3 9100 or AMD Ryzen 3 1300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia Geforce GTX 960 or AMD RX 470 <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 60+ FPS</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":40,"final":749,"final_formatted":"$7.49 USD","initial":1249,"initial_formatted":"$12.49"},"publishers":["Firesquid"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"recommendations":{"total":288},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"20 Nov, 2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cWithout a license, without any flash, with only basic but surprisingly effective art, Traptics' Xenopurge cuts to the heart of Aliens. It's tense, claustrophobic and everyone is probably going to die. It's great!\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cXenopurge is an auto-battler that is well worth picking up and playing. It captures the tense feeling of trying to keep a squad alive as they carry out their mission, while the odds get increasingly worse the longer they are exposed. If you love the vibe of the Alien franchise, and want to try and command squads on runs to fight back against an alien threat, then Xenopurge should be on your list.\u201d<br>Sixth Axis<br><br>\u201cXenopurge is one of, if not the most, unique games I\u2019ve played this year. A game where \u201cimmersion\u201d is the operating word\u201d<br>Try Hard Guides<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983410/654d86e5836c8ff7b